{"seq":1,"slug":"sellthrough-depth-margin-recovery","title":"售罄率/降价幅度/毛利回收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/markdown-ops-metric/sellthrough-depth-margin-recovery","wordCount":1932,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"售罄率-降价幅度-毛利回收\">售罄率/降价幅度/毛利回收</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>清仓的度量有三个基础指标，它们的定义看起来都不言自明，但每一个都有至少两种口径，而口径选择会<strong>直接决定结论的正负</strong>。</p>\n<p>**售罄率（sell-through rate）**衡量期间内可供的货卖掉了多少比例。它是最直观的&quot;清得好不好&quot;指标，也是最容易被折扣深度操纵的指标——降到底，售罄率必然高。**降价幅度（markdown depth）**衡量价格让渡了多大比例，是售罄率的成本项。**毛利回收（margin recovery）**衡量每单位库存回收了多少价值，是最终的账。</p>\n<p>三者的关系可以用一句话概括：<strong>售罄率是过程指标，毛利回收是结果指标，降价幅度是两者之间的汇率</strong>。只看售罄率的团队必然会踩油门到底；只看毛利回收的团队会惜降而留下死库存。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[期初可清库存] --&gt; B[期间可供量]&#10;  B --&gt; C{期间销量}&#10;  C --&gt; D[售罄率 = 销量/可供量]&#10;  B --&gt; E[期初成本基础]&#10;  C --&gt; F[实际成交额]&#10;  D --&gt; G[清仓完成度]&#10;  E --&gt; H[降幅 = 1 - 成交价/原价]&#10;  F --&gt; I[毛利回收 = 成交额-成本-履约]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  G --&gt; J[综合判定]&#10;  I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[期初可清库存] --&gt; B[期间可供量]\n  B --&gt; C{期间销量}\n  C --&gt; D[售罄率 = 销量/可供量]\n  B --&gt; E[期初成本基础]\n  C --&gt; F[实际成交额]\n  D --&gt; G[清仓完成度]\n  E --&gt; H[降幅 = 1 - 成交价/原价]\n  F --&gt; I[毛利回收 = 成交额-成本-履约]\n  H --&gt; I\n  G --&gt; J[综合判定]\n  I --&gt; J</pre><h2 id=\"售罄率的定义陷阱\">售罄率的定义陷阱</h2><h3 id=\"分母是-可供量-而非-期初库存\">分母是&quot;可供量&quot;而非&quot;期初库存&quot;</h3><p>售罄率最常见的错误是把分母写成期初库存。若期间有补货，期初库存会低估可供量，售罄率被虚高。正确分母是<strong>期间可供量</strong>（期初库存 + 期间到货），或在无补货场景下明确声明使用期初库存。</p>\n<p>零售语境下售罄率的定义是&quot;供应商发出后零售商实际售出的百分比&quot;，通常在给定期间（一般一个月）内衡量，其含义是&quot;售出件数 ÷ 可供件数 × 100%&quot;（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sell-through\">Sell-through，Wikipedia</a>）。这个定义强调了&quot;shipped&quot;这个动作——分母是供给侧的投放量，而不是时点的库存余额。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与库存周转的关系\">与库存周转的关系</h3><p>售罄率与库存周转率经常被混为一谈。周转率是&quot;销货成本 / 平均库存成本&quot;，衡量的是资金效率，其标准换算是<strong>平均售出天数 = 365 / 周转率</strong>，而平均库存取 <code>(期初 + 期末) / 2</code>（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inventory_turnover\">Inventory turnover，Wikipedia</a>）。两者的区别在于：售罄率以&quot;件&quot;为单位、面向一个销售窗口；周转率以&quot;成本金额&quot;为单位、面向一个完整期间，且聚合层级通常更粗。清仓看板应以售罄率为主（能定位到单品与窗口），以周转率作为财务侧的对照。</p>\n<h3 id=\"窗口对齐问题\">窗口对齐问题</h3><p>售罄率与窗口强相关：同一批货在 30 天窗口下的售罄率必然低于 90 天窗口。因此跨批次比较售罄率时，必须用<strong>同一窗口长度</strong>或<strong>同一截止线</strong>，否则得到的是窗口长度的差异，而不是清仓效果的差异。这是清仓复盘里最常见的口径错误之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"降价幅度的度量\">降价幅度的度量</h2><h3 id=\"三种口径\">三种口径</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>计算</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标价降幅</td>\n<td>1 − 标价/原价</td>\n<td>对外沟通</td>\n<td>未必是实际成交折让</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成交降幅</td>\n<td>1 − 成交均价/原价</td>\n<td>真实的价量权衡</td>\n<td>需剔除退货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本回收率</td>\n<td>成交均价/单位成本</td>\n<td>是否亏损</td>\n<td>未含履约成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>清仓决策应统一使用<strong>成交降幅</strong>作为过程指标，用<strong>成本回收率</strong>作为底线指标。标价降幅只用于对外展示与合规，不能用于内部评估——因为叠加优惠券、会员价、满减之后，成交价与标价往往相差很大。</p>\n<h3 id=\"降价频次也是一个指标\">降价频次也是一个指标</h3><p>幅度之外，<strong>降价次数</strong>本身值得监控。同一个 SKU 在一季里被降了 6 次，说明首次降价的深度不足或触发条件太保守。频次过高还有一个隐性成本：消费者会观察到降价节奏并据此等待，把需求推到更深的折扣档位。</p>\n<h3 id=\"退货对成交口径的污染\">退货对成交口径的污染</h3><p>成交降幅若按&quot;下单即计&quot;计算，会在数周后因退货而失真。清仓商品的退货率通常高于常规商品（消费者买得冲动的成分更大），因此必须使用<strong>净成交</strong>口径，并承认数周的确认延迟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"毛利回收-最终的账\">毛利回收：最终的账</h2><h3 id=\"从销售毛利到贡献毛利\">从销售毛利到贡献毛利</h3><p>第 2 章已经指出，清仓决策应使用<strong>贡献毛利</strong>（扣除可变履约成本）而非销售毛利。在度量层，这条原则同样适用，且需要在指标定义中显式包含：拣货、包装、配送、支付手续费、以及退货预期成本。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>毛利回收率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>net</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>unit</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>fulfill</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>unit</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{毛利回收率} = \\frac{P*{\\text{net}} - C*{\\text{unit}} - C*{\\text{fulfill}}}{C*{\\text{unit}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">毛利回收率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">unit</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">unit</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fulfill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{net}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是净成交均价（扣退货与优惠），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>unit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{unit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单位成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fulfill</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fulfill}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fulfill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单位可变履约成本。该值为负意味着每卖一件都在扩大亏损——在清仓语境下这不必然是错的（有时卖比报废更划算），但必须<strong>在指标上可见</strong>，而不是被&quot;销量增长&quot;掩盖。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与跌价准备的对照\">与跌价准备的对照</h3><p>存货按成本与可变现净值孰低计量，跌价损失在发生期间确认为费用（<a href=\"https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/list-of-standards/ias-2-inventories/\">IAS 2 Inventories，IFRS Foundation</a>）。因此运营口径的&quot;毛利回收率&quot;与财务口径的&quot;可变现净值&quot;应当在同一个事实上收敛：若运营认为某批货的回收率是 60%，财务的可变现净值估计就不应显著高于成本价的 60%（减去销售必需费用）。两者长期背离，通常意味着有一方的口径是错的，或者运营在做数据美化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三指标的联合判读\">三指标的联合判读</h2><p>单看一个指标必然得出错误结论，正确做法是把三者放进同一张判读表：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P[批次度量] --&gt; Q1{售罄率达标?}&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|是| Q2{回收率达标?}&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|否| R1{降幅是否已到上限?}&#10;  R1 --&gt;|否| S1[加深降价 / 提前进档]&#10;  R1 --&gt;|是| S2[转渠道: B2B/处置]&#10;  Q2 --&gt;|是| T1[健康: 保持策略]&#10;  Q2 --&gt;|否| R2{是否高价值品牌品?}&#10;  R2 --&gt;|是| T2[降幅过深: 收紧档位&lt;br/&gt;改走隔离渠道]&#10;  R2 --&gt;|否| T3[可接受: 确认处置成本&lt;br/&gt;低于报废成本]\">graph TD\n  P[批次度量] --&gt; Q1{售罄率达标?}\n  Q1 --&gt;|是| Q2{回收率达标?}\n  Q1 --&gt;|否| R1{降幅是否已到上限?}\n  R1 --&gt;|否| S1[加深降价 / 提前进档]\n  R1 --&gt;|是| S2[转渠道: B2B/处置]\n  Q2 --&gt;|是| T1[健康: 保持策略]\n  Q2 --&gt;|否| R2{是否高价值品牌品?}\n  R2 --&gt;|是| T2[降幅过深: 收紧档位&lt;br/&gt;改走隔离渠道]\n  R2 --&gt;|否| T3[可接受: 确认处置成本&lt;br/&gt;低于报废成本]</pre><p>判读的关键分支是&quot;售罄率不达标但降幅已到上限&quot;——这意味着价格工具已经用尽，继续降价只会扩大亏损，正确动作是<strong>换渠道</strong>而非继续降价，转入 <a href=\"../clearance-channels/b2b-bulk-liquidation-auction\">B2B 批量清货</a> 或 <a href=\"../clearance-channels/donation-disposal-salvage-proof\">处置路径</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个可落地的度量表结构\">一个可落地的度量表结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE clearance_perf_weekly (&#10;  plan_id        VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  sku_id         BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  week_index     INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  window_start   DATE        NOT NULL,&#10;  available_units DECIMAL(18,3) NOT NULL,   -- 期间可供量（含到货）&#10;  net_units       DECIMAL(18,3) NOT NULL,   -- 净销量（扣退货/取消）&#10;  gross_sales     DECIMAL(18,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  net_sales       DECIMAL(18,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  unit_cost       DECIMAL(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  fulfill_cost    DECIMAL(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  list_price      DECIMAL(18,4) NOT NULL,   -- 原价（窗口起点价）&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (plan_id, sku_id, week_index)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 三指标一次性算出，避免各自口径漂移&#10;SELECT plan_id, sku_id,&#10;       SUM(net_units) / NULLIF(SUM(available_units),0)                      AS sell_through,&#10;       1 - (SUM(net_sales) / NULLIF(SUM(net_units),0)) / NULLIF(SUM(list_price)/COUNT(*),0)&#10;                                                                            AS net_markdown_depth,&#10;       (SUM(net_sales) - SUM(net_units * (unit_cost + fulfill_cost)))&#10;         / NULLIF(SUM(net_units * unit_cost),0)                             AS margin_recovery&#10;FROM clearance_perf_weekly&#10;GROUP BY plan_id, sku_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> clearance_perf_weekly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plan_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  week_index     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  window_start   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  available_units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 期间可供量（含到货）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  net_units       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 净销量（扣退货/取消）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gross_sales     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  net_sales       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  unit_cost       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fulfill_cost    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  list_price      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 原价（窗口起点价）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (plan_id, sku_id, week_index)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 三指标一次性算出，避免各自口径漂移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plan_id, sku_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(net_units) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(available_units),</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sell_through,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(net_sales) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(net_units),</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(list_price)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                                                            AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_markdown_depth,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(net_sales) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(net_units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (unit_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fulfill_cost)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(net_units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_cost),</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> margin_recovery</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clearance_perf_weekly</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plan_id, sku_id;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把三个公式放在同一个查询里，是防止口径漂移的工程手段：指标在同一处定义、同一处演进，下游看板只读结果，不再各自实现一遍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻章节的衔接\">与相邻章节的衔接</h2><p>本章的度量结果有两条下游路径：一是汇总为品类与季度的账，进入 <a href=\"markdown-budget-category-review\">降价预算与品类复盘</a>；二是暴露与促销活动的价格冲突，进入 <a href=\"promo-competitor-price-coordination\">与促销引擎/竞品价协同</a>。度量本身不是终点——它的价值在于让&quot;该加深降价&quot;与&quot;该换渠道&quot;这两个完全相反的动作可以从同一张表里被区分出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>售罄率是过程指标、毛利回收是结果指标、降价幅度是两者之间的汇率；单看任何一个都会得出反向结论。</li>\n<li>售罄率的分母是<strong>期间可供量</strong>（含到货），不是期初库存；跨批次比较必须对齐窗口长度。</li>\n<li>幅度应统一用<strong>成交降幅</strong>（净成交，剔退货）评估，标价降幅只用于对外展示；降价频次本身值得监控，过高说明触发条件过保守。</li>\n<li>毛利回收必须用<strong>贡献毛利</strong>口径（扣除拣货、包装、配送、支付、退货预期）；回收率为负不必然是错的，但必须在指标上可见。</li>\n<li>运营回收率应与财务可变现净值估计在事实上收敛；长期背离说明口径有误或数据被美化。</li>\n<li>判读的关键分支是&quot;售罄率不达标但降幅已触顶&quot;——此时应换渠道，进入 <a href=\"../clearance-channels/b2b-bulk-liquidation-auction\">B2B 批量清货</a> 或 <a href=\"../clearance-channels/donation-disposal-salvage-proof\">处置</a>，而不是继续降价。</li>\n<li>三个指标应在同一处定义、同一段 SQL 内计算，防止各自实现导致的口径漂移。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"售罄率/降价幅度/毛利回收","id":"售罄率-降价幅度-毛利回收"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"售罄率的定义陷阱","id":"售罄率的定义陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"分母是\"可供量\"而非\"期初库存\"","id":"分母是-可供量-而非-期初库存"},{"level":3,"text":"与库存周转的关系","id":"与库存周转的关系"},{"level":3,"text":"窗口对齐问题","id":"窗口对齐问题"},{"level":2,"text":"降价幅度的度量","id":"降价幅度的度量"},{"level":3,"text":"三种口径","id":"三种口径"},{"level":3,"text":"降价频次也是一个指标","id":"降价频次也是一个指标"},{"level":3,"text":"退货对成交口径的污染","id":"退货对成交口径的污染"},{"level":2,"text":"毛利回收：最终的账","id":"毛利回收-最终的账"},{"level":3,"text":"从销售毛利到贡献毛利","id":"从销售毛利到贡献毛利"},{"level":3,"text":"与跌价准备的对照","id":"与跌价准备的对照"},{"level":2,"text":"三指标的联合判读","id":"三指标的联合判读"},{"level":3,"text":"一个可落地的度量表结构","id":"一个可落地的度量表结构"},{"level":2,"text":"与相邻章节的衔接","id":"与相邻章节的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"捐赠/报废与残值凭证（边界126）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/clearance-channels/donation-disposal-salvage-proof"},"next":{"title":"降价预算与品类复盘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/markdown-ops-metric/markdown-budget-category-review"}}